## 3. Complete-basis and convergence mathematics

Let:

```text
S_top = obligations derived from CKB protocol, dependency/conflict semantics,
        hostile inputs, external observations and the final goal
S_bottom = obligations generated from production/API/config/task/lock/effect
           surfaces, develop compatibility and historical legal counterexamples
M = obligations with exactly one machine owner and one disposition

complete(B) iff (S_top - M = empty) and (S_bottom - M = empty)
```

Closed-world agreement inside `M` is insufficient. Both differences are
generated independently and must be empty before Construction can close.
Every prose `OPEN`, `SUPPORTED`, release blocker or legal counterexample must
map to exactly one construction-rank item or an exact content-addressed terminal
disposition.

The machine-owned state is:

```text
State = Construction(B, C) | Acceptance(U, Q) | Accepted(U)

rho_C = (
  open_release_laws,
  open_compatibility_and_landing_decisions,
  unclosed_registered_semantic_families,
  unowned_or_duplicated_production_items,
  incomplete_refinement_edges
)

rho_A = (unclassified_current_obligations,
         stale_evidence_edges,
         failing_required_gates)
```

Each coordinate contains named items, not only a count. An ordinary phase step
must remove or replace an item while strictly decreasing the appropriate
lexicographic rank. New legal semantics, production changes or model/release-law
test changes return to Construction. Evidence-only changes invalidate only the
changed evidence node and its transitive successors.

The optimality-certificate requirements are the refinement-rank items
themselves. A requirement disappears only when
`optimality_protocol.construction_evidence` binds it to a tracked artifact and
SHA-256; the architecture and simplification phase partitions are mechanically
checked. Thus candidate exploration cannot claim progress by changing prose.

Termination is conditional on a fixed complete basis and eventually stable
construction inputs. New external facts may reopen Construction; this is not
hidden nontermination.

The anti-snowball measure is the exact
`optimization_goal.complexity_objective`. A mechanism may remain only with one
semantic owner, deletion counterexample and bounded cost. After each slice,
generate source roles and remove duplicate policy, obsolete paths and proof
machinery that no longer owns a distinct falsifier. Cleanup occurs before the
final evidence universe freezes.

